  "title": "Chef John's Mango Cranberry Sauce",
  "description": "Thanksgiving dinner will taste even more awesome with this cranberry sauce flavored with mango, lemon, and orange with a spicy kick from hot sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
